{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.1777272449645","title":"Inference dan training adalah dua tahap berbeda","desc":"Training membangun kemampuan umum; inference menggunakan kemampuan itu pada input baru.","updated":1777349975838,"created":1777272449633,"tags":["zettel","ai","the-developers-guide-to-ai","chapter-1"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.1777272449645","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"cdca16adedfba4311d39050c4c1de369","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449645","id":"zettel.1777272449645","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449645","id":"zettel.1777272449645","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.ai","alias":"ai","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.ai"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449645","id":"zettel.1777272449645","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.the-developers-guide-to-ai","alias":"the-developers-guide-to-ai","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449645","id":"zettel.1777272449645","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.chapter-1","alias":"chapter-1","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.chapter-1"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449645","id":"zettel.1777272449645","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":3,"offset":1154},"end":{"line":28,"column":51,"offset":1202},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449645","id":"zettel.1777272449645","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":3,"offset":1205},"end":{"line":29,"column":48,"offset":1250},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449652","id":"zettel.1777272449652","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":3,"offset":1702},"end":{"line":33,"column":27,"offset":1726},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.1777272449645"},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.1777362905431","id":"zettel.1777362905431","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":37,"column":3,"offset":2002},"end":{"line":37,"column":27,"offset":2026},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.1777272449645"},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai","id":"zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":3,"offset":1169},"end":{"line":18,"column":27,"offset":1193},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.1777272449645"}],"anchors":{"ide-inti":{"type":"header","text":"Ide inti","value":"ide-inti","line":15,"column":0,"depth":2},"quote-baseline":{"type":"header","text":"Quote baseline","value":"quote-baseline","line":19,"column":0,"depth":2},"kenapa-ini-core":{"type":"header","text":"Kenapa ini core","value":"kenapa-ini-core","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2},"sumber":{"type":"header","text":"Sumber","value":"sumber","line":38,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"inference-dan-training-adalah-dua-tahap-berbeda\">Inference dan training adalah dua tahap berbeda<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#inference-dan-training-adalah-dua-tahap-berbeda\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"ide-inti\">Ide inti<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#ide-inti\"></a></h2>\n<p>Yang gue tangkap dari quote ini adalah bahwa ada perbedaan fundamental antara dua hal: model belajar selama training, dan model menjalankan apa yang sudah dipelajari selama inference. Ini penting supaya kita tidak salah menafsirkan prompt sebagai \"training kecil-kecilan\" atau mengira request run-time mengubah model.</p>\n<h2 id=\"quote-baseline\">Quote baseline<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#quote-baseline\"></a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The process ... when given new, unseen data ... is referred to as inference.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"kenapa-ini-core\">Kenapa ini core<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#kenapa-ini-core\"></a></h2>\n<p>Quote ini penting karena dia membantu membedakan dua jalur utama AI:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>training = membangun kemampuan umum dari data,</li>\n<li>inference = menggunakan kemampuan itu pada input baru.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Perbedaan ini langsung nge-link ke beberapa keputusan lain:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>prompt vs training: prompt mengarahkan model saat inference, training mengubah model sebelumnya.</li>\n<li>RAG vs pretraining: RAG menambahkan konteks runtime, pretraining membentuk kemampuan umum.</li>\n<li>fine-tune vs runtime context: fine-tune adalah perubahan model, runtime context adalah memberi info baru saat inference.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Kalau kita tidak paham ini, kita bisa salah kaprah dan terlalu cepat menganggap \"train something\" adalah jawaban pertama.</p>\n<h2 id=\"sumber\">Sumber<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#sumber\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Chapter 1</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI sebagai literature note</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">the-developers-guide-to-ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">chapter-1 (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777272449652\">Streaming token dapat diubah jadi UX responsif</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777362905431\">Grounding adalah menyuplai konteks yang hilang saat inference tanpa mengubah model</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">MOC The Developer's Guide to AI</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly 